r","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids in Van Buren County shows 75 years of record since 1951, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them. In 2025, November to December ran 25% of normal on the middle of the grids, while April to May ran 163%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 42% and February to March at 44% on the middle of the grids. Grid 18749 had its driest year in 1980 at 60%.</p>"}
